#X text 1673 295 LIST-TRIM FIX (added 2026-08-21) -- [list prepend prep] (5-8) does not produce a genuine "prep"-selector message on its own -- it stays selector "list" with "prep" as just the first data atom\\\, so slot_router_stem.pd's own leading "route prep commit stop resume" would never have matched it. 41-44 strip that wrapper before each stem's prepare message reaches its slot_router_stem instance -- same fix already applied upstream in buffer_manager.pd/buffer_manager_stem.pd.;
